{{!
  <BottomSheet> — the ONE shared mobile bottom-sheet shell (CC-260 doctrine:
  extract a single sheet pattern, don't build one per caller; CC-271's picker
  work is the intended second consumer).

  Two positionings, same markup:
    * below md — fixed bottom sheet + dimmed scrim, safe-area bottom padding,
      capped at 80dvh and scrollable.
    * md and up — the anchored popover we've always had. The CALLER must
      provide the positioning context (`class="relative"` on its wrapper).

  Z-ORDER (CC-260 landmine 10): budget is tee-box 50 < chat 60 < site-header
  70 / route-footer 70 < mobile-overlay 75 < mobile-drawer 80. The sheet sits
  at 72 (scrim 71) — above the sticky header and the fixed route-footer it
  overlaps, still BELOW the drawer so the drawer always wins. At md+ it drops
  back to the popover's original 50/40 inside the caller's stacking context.

  @onClose   (required) closes the sheet — scrim tap and the mobile X.
  @label     accessible name, also the mobile sheet heading. Default "Options".
  @role      role for the panel element (e.g. "menu"). Optional.
  @panelClass extra classes for the panel. Optional.
}}
<button
  type="button"
  aria-label="Close {{if @label @label 'options'}}"
  class="fixed inset-0 z-[71] cursor-default bg-black/40 md:z-40 md:bg-transparent"
  {{on "click" @onClose}}
></button>

<div
  class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-[72] max-h-[80dvh] overflow-y-auto rounded-t-2xl border-t border-gray-200 bg-white px-4 pb-[max(1rem,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] pt-2 shadow-2xl dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 md:absolute md:inset-x-auto md:bottom-auto md:right-0 md:z-50 md:mt-2 md:max-h-none md:w-72 md:overflow-visible md:rounded-lg md:border md:p-3 md:shadow-lg
    {{@panelClass}}"
  role={{@role}}
  aria-label={{@label}}
  data-bottom-sheet
>
  {{! In-flow grid, not an absolutely-positioned X: the panel is the scroll
      container below md, so an absolute child would detach from the header
      as soon as the facet list overflowed. }}
  <div class="mb-1 grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] items-center md:hidden">
    <span></span>
    <span
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="block h-1 w-10 rounded-full bg-gray-300 dark:bg-gray-600"
    ></span>
    <button
      type="button"
      class="justify-self-end rounded p-1 text-gray-500 hover:bg-gray-100 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:bg-gray-700"
      aria-label="Close {{if @label @label 'options'}}"
      {{on "click" @onClose}}
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke-width="1.5"
        stroke="currentColor"
        class="size-5"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12"
        />
      </svg>
    </button>
  </div>

  {{yield}}
</div>